t=\"https://www.valkorsystems.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Valkor Systems\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.valkorsystems.com/og.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Valkor Systems school-controlled operational awareness command center.\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Valkor Systems | School-controlled operational awareness.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Review movement exceptions, pass activity, receiver health, and incident follow-up from one calm school-hours command center.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.valkorsystems.com/og.png\"/><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png\" type=\"image/png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"__variable_f367f3 bg-valkor-bg font-sans text-valkor-text antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Valkor Systems\",\"url\":\"https://www.valkorsystems.com\",\"logo\":\"https://www.valkorsystems.com/valkor-logo.png\",\"email\":\"jackson@valkorsystems.com\"}</script><header class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-[100] border-b border-slate-200/70 bg-white/95 shadow-sm shadow-slate-200/40 backdrop-blur-2xl\"><nav class=\"mx-auto flex h-[4.5rem] max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" aria-label=\"Valkor Systems home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Valkor Systems\" width=\"156\" height=\"45\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-aut